  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Our hero, Kevin Power, is late for his favorite band's concert! It's up to you to get Kevin Power to his concert safely while crushing as many pedestrians as you can! Take control of a car on an automatically-scrolling playfield and swerve to run over poodles, geezers, cripples, and the occasional baby carriage while collecting bottles of booze and barrels of fuel and dodging other cars, boulders, and the occasional giant fat pedestrian, all of which will instantly ruin your car."
    }
